{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-p040a","title":"焦胜上言校石文与旧图不同","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-p040a-account","label":"裴注·搜神记","text":"晋泰始三年焦胜据留郡图校石文，具图上报。","evidence":["mingdi-e-p040a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0086","role":"上报","evidence":["mingdi-e-p040a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"晋泰始三年","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["mingdi-e-p040a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-p040a-q","source_order":[3,322,"P040a"],"order":893}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0086","name":"焦胜","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-e-p040a-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-6d29a6aa193e4fd1a8c4","layer":"pei","quote":"至晋泰始三年，张掖太守焦胜上言：‘以留郡本国图，校今石文，文字多少不同，谨具图上。’按其文有五马象：其一有人平上帻，执戟而乘之；其一有若马形而不成。其字有‘金’，有‘中’，有‘大司马’，有‘王’，有‘大吉’，有‘正’，有‘开寿’；其一成行，曰‘金当取之’。","attribution":"裴注·搜神记","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":321,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2c1e6ca07172a38e9ecd","start":139,"end":267,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
